.TH RATASH-LATENCY-SHOW 1 2026-08-01 "Ratash 0.1.1" "Ratash User Commands"
.SH NAME
ratash\-latency\-show \- Show the latency sample for one Active Profile Node
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBratash latency show\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINODE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the latency sample for one Active Profile Node
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINODE\fR>
Source\-aware Node ID or unique case\-sensitive display name
